# Planning only — no implementation yet

This repository is currently in **planning mode**.

## Allowed now

- Update plans under `docs/plans/`
- Update living docs (`docs/PRODUCT.md`, `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`, `docs/ROADMAP.md`, `README.md`)
- Update Cursor rules that guide planning, standards, or documentation sync
- Record decisions, open questions, acceptance criteria, and non-goals

## Not allowed yet

- Do **not** create or modify plugin implementation files (PHP bootstrap, `includes/`, admin UI JS/CSS, REST/AJAX handlers, tests that exercise product code, build tooling for the plugin, etc.).
- Do **not** scaffold `wp-taxonomy-tree.php`, Composer/npm plugin packages, or activation/uninstall code unless the plan status explicitly leaves planning mode.
- Do **not** “quickly implement” MVP slices while refining the plan.

## Exit condition

Implementation may begin only when **all** of the following are true:

1. `docs/plans/project-plan.md` status is no longer `planning` (for example `ready-to-implement` or later).
2. The plan decision log records that planning is complete enough to start coding.
3. The user explicitly asks to start implementation.

Until then, keep every change planning-and-docs only, and sync living docs whenever the plan changes.
